Exactly when to #enhance which skill is a strategy to ponder.  Going to
skilled in long sword, two weapon and bow can make sense before going to
expert in any of them.  Or various other mixtures.  I actually like to
max out dagger to basic as my first #enhance and then some sort of
alternation among the others.

Because of the way arrows disappear there's some sense in not practicing
bow until your luck is max and you have some holy water for blessing. 
That's an altar and a sacrifest.  I like to do it starting in mine town
on the way back up from mines end or at an altar in the main dungeon
somewhere between the mine entrance and Medusa.

By the Castle it's nice to be able to stand in line and multi-fire
volleys of death into the crowd lining up on the bridge so it's nice to
be expert at bow by the time I reach the Castle.

